ious range of 56% to 59%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2019-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Bhojwani","x":"Through Colonial Penn, we continue to grow our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2019-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Bhojwani","x":"This makes us a top five direct-to-consumer life insurer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2019-07-31","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary Bhojwani","x":"We expect our direct-to-consumer channel to play an increasingly important role in our future as we evolve to offer an omnichannel customer experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"…franchise profitably launching new products and services including a new Medicare advantage pilot with Humana in our direct-to-consumer channel expanding to the right to slightly younger wealthier consumers within the middle income market and deploying excess capital to its highest and best use.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Colonial Penn our direct-to-consumer channel delivered record-setting third quarter sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Colonial Penn is piloting third-party direct-to-consumer Medicare Advantage sales with Humana through our telesales force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"It is an example of how we are leveraging our strong consumer brand and valuable direct-to-consumer distribution channel to sell both manufactured and third-party products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul H. McDonough","x":"The agreement and associated restructuring costs resulted in approximately $2 million charge to nonoperating earnings in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"One immediate example of the technology partnership we announced today which will generate $20 million of cost savings while making our IT delivery more effective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2020-02-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life and health sales were up 5% for the full year, which included record sales in our worksite and direct-to-consumer businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/12/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2020-02-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"We also piloted Humana Medicare Advantage and our own manufactured Medicare Supplement product through our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/12/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2020-02-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Results from the pilots are preliminary, but illustrate the range and types of opportunities we expect to leverage with our industry-leading direct-to-consumer capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/12/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2020-02-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Colonial Penn is a top five direct-to-consumer insurance business with significant brand awareness and a highly leverageable platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/12/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2019 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul H. McDonough","x":"This was comprised of both severance and cost associated with our outsourcing arrangement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/12/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2020-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"In fact, demand for some of our products, especially our direct-to-consumer life insurance, has increased meaningfully.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2020-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Direct-to-consumer life sales are surging, and this channel serves as a key lead source to our exclusive agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2020-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"For example, in late March, when our exclusive agents were increasingly unable to meet with prospects face-to-face, we ramped up our direct-to-consumer advertising spend and accelerated the lead sharing with our exclusive agent force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2020-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Paul H. McDonough","x":"Direct-to-consumer channel inside the Consumer Division outperformed in April with life NAP up 28%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2020-05-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"We also introduced financial support programs for our exclusive agents who have seen their businesses disrupted and their livelihood challenged.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"This blend of virtual and local service resulted in higher conversion rates without any degradation to the direct-to-consumer business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life sales were up nicely, fueled by strong direct-to-consumer growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Our direct-to-consumer life sales were up 52% year-over-year to a record $30 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Second, we launched the direct-to-consumer marketing program around our active care critical illness product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"At a time when many American workers are unemployed, we pledge that there will be no COVID-related layoffs in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul H. McDonough","x":"Regarding expenses, allocated expenses decreased by $7 million or 5% year-over-year, driven by the IT restructuring we announced last fall, as well as decreased travel and marketing-related expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2020-08-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"We introduced financial support programs for our exclusive agents who have seen their businesses disrupted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2020-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"CNO has a unique set of capabilities in our 5,000-agent strong exclusive distribution force and our top five direct-to-consumer business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2020-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"By fast-tracking various digital direct-to-consumer and cross-channel collaboration programs, we accomplished in about six weeks what was originally expected to take more than six months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2020-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life sales were up at solid 19% fueled by both continued strong direct-to-consumer growth and exclusive field agent sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2020-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Direct-to-consumer life sales were up 23% which comprised just over half of our total life sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2021-02-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Within the Consumer division, we've continued to build upon success with our direct-to-consumer life business and cross-channel collaboration efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2021-02-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Just as we successfully scaled and became a top five provider of direct-to-consumer life insurance, we intend to profitably grow the direct-to-consumer healthcare business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2021-02-10","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life sales were up 6% for the quarter and 12% for the full year, fueled by both continued strong direct-to-consumer growth and a sharp increase in sales from our exclusive field agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2020 Q4","e":"cno","d":"2021-02-10","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Direct-to-consumer life sales, which comprised about half of our total life sales, were up 10%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2021-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Life sales were up a record 29% for the quarter fueled by record direct-to-consumer sales and a significant increase in production from our exclusive field agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2021-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Direct-to-consumer life sales grew 38% to a record $31 million and comprised nearly 2/3 of total life sales within the division.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2021-04-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Supported by leads generated from our direct-to-consumer business, life sales completed by our exclusive field agents were up 29% to $21 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q1","e":"cno","d":"2021-04-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"Second, please remember, even before the pandemic, we were showing quite robust direct-to-consumer life sales growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2021-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life sales remained strong, fueled by continued momentum in both our direct to consumer and exclusive field agent channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2021-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Direct to consumer life sales were level with the record production in the prior period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q2","e":"cno","d":"2021-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Leads from our direct to consumer business supported this growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2021-10-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Life sales were up modestly compared to 2020 fueled largely by continued momentum in our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2021-10-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"I continue to be pleased with how we're executing on our transformation to leverage synergies between our agent and direct-to-consumer businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2021-10-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Gary C. Bhojwani","x":"Direct-to-consumer life sales were up 13% on top of 23% growth in the prior period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2021 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2021-10-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Paul H. McDonough","x":"This reflects our continued positive momentum, particularly in our direct-to-consumer business, coupled with the challenges of a very tight labor market and for our worksite business, ongoing delays in office reopenings and in businesses, allowing on-site enrollments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/cno-financial-group-inc-cno-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CNO 2025 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2025-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"We are pleased with our life business results, including total life insurance up 33% and record direct-to-consumer life insurance sales up 56%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cno-financial-cno-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CNO 2025 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2025-11-04","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Joel Krueger","x":"My first question was on the really strong DTC sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cno-financial-cno-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CNO 2025 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Chandru Bhojwani","x":"In October, we decided to streamline our worksite operations and exit the fee services business to sharpen our focus on the core insurance business and align resources to proven growth areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cno-financial-cno-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CNO 2025 Q3","e":"cno","d":"2025-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Harrington McDonough","x":"We are raising our guidance for excess cash flow to the holding company to the range of $365 million to $385 million, up from $200 million to $250 million, which incorporates the impact of our new Bermuda reinsurance transaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cno-financial-cno-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CNO 2026 Q1","e":"cno","d"